# Project contract

Read AGENTS.md, CONTRIBUTING.md and docs/architecture.md before changes.
New features follow docs/development/feature-checklist.md.
Provider work follows docs/development/provider-guide.md even for new files.
Tooling work follows docs/development/workflows.md.
Keep Windows/macOS scope, data, credential and paste safety boundaries intact.
Keep dev, F5, check and build usable; report unverified platforms honestly.
No paid calls, permission changes, automated UI acceptance or remote publication
without authorization. Do not undo unrelated user work.
Parallel edits are expected: reload affected files before each patch, merge with
their latest contents, and continue without asking for confirmation solely because
they changed concurrently. Adapt stale patches and verify the integrated result.
Stop only for destructive or materially ambiguous conflicts that cannot be merged safely.
